1%","+  (5/5). Hybrid (squared level, abs profile) slightly weaker. Verdict: keep est=abs, scale 1.2.","+- fast intra-path stochastic vol (to fix a peaked+U-shaped 1-min PIT for BTC): worse on every","+  cell (+0.05..+0.5%). The PIT shape comes from level-forecast dispersion, not from the","+  innovation law. Discard.","+","+## Benchmark: the best SINGLE miner, not the per-prompt p10","+No individual miner reaches the per-prompt p10 (it mixes different miners per prompt): the best","+single miner (full coverage) in window A is +2.1% vs p10 in 1h, +1.1% in crypto-24h, +1.2% in","+com-equ-24h, and the top of the field is made of clones with identical scores. evalrun now","+reports vs_bestminer% (best single miner over the whole competition, chosen ex post).","+v3 (committed) vs best single miner — window A: crypto-24h +0.11%, com-equ -0.17%, 1h +0.64%","+(biased, see above); window B: crypto-24h +0.31%, com-equ +0.20%, crypto-1h +0.42%."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/workspace/agent/journal.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FA98fcUaVwYqUdEpQwtUJ6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
